{"id":"furcht","lemma":"Furcht","pos":"noun","rank":2614,"glosses":["fear; fright; anxiety"],"ipa":"/fʊrçt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/De-Furcht.ogg/De-Furcht.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Furcht"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie sind ohne Furcht.","en":"They're fearless.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Er hat Furcht vor dem Tod.","en":"He is afraid of death.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"death"}]},{"text":"Ich sah Furcht in seinen Augen.","en":"I saw fear in his eyes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"eye","l":"Auge"}]},{"text":"Seine Augen verrieten seine Furcht.","en":"His eyes betrayed his fear.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"eye","l":"Auge"},{"g":"to betray","l":"verraten"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Er wurde von Furcht ergriffen.","en":"He was seized with fear.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"from / of"},null,{"g":"to seize, capture","l":"ergreifen"}]}]}